@page "/license"
@inject ContentStore Content

@* Bespoke rather than Markdown because the list of adapted pages is generated
   from frontmatter. A hand-maintained list is a list that goes stale, and this
   is the page where going stale is a licence problem. *@

<PageMeta Title="Licence and credits"
          Description="Content on this site is CC BY 4.0. Code is MIT. Here is every page adapted from PauseAI, and what each licence does and does not cover." />

<div class="wrap page-head">
    <h1>Licence and credits</h1>
    <p class="lead">
        Take what is useful. Credit where it is due, including where it is due
        to someone other than us.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="wrap" style="padding-bottom: 4rem">
    <article class="prose">
        <h2>Content</h2>
        <p>
            Everything written on this site is licensed
            <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="license noopener">Creative
            Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)</a>. You may copy,
            redistribute, adapt and build on it, for any purpose including
            commercially, provided you credit PhillyPause, link to the licence,
            and say if you made changes.
        </p>

        <h2>Code</h2>
        <p>
            The source of this website is licensed
            <a href="https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT" target="_blank" rel="noopener">MIT</a>
            and lives at
            <a href="https://github.com/PhillyPause/Platform" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PhillyPause/Platform</a>.
            Fork it.
        </p>

        <h2>What neither licence covers</h2>
        <p>
            <strong>Logos and trademarks.</strong> CC BY 4.0 grants no trademark
            rights, and MIT grants none either. That applies to PauseAI's mark,
            to PauseAI US's mark, and to ours. Do not treat a licence on text as
            permission to use an organisation's identity.
        </p>
        <p>
            Our own previous mark was derived from PauseAI US's logo and has been
            retired for exactly this reason. A replacement is in progress; see
            <a href="/press">press</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Adapted from PauseAI</h2>
        <p>
            PauseAI Global publishes its site content and code under
            <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="license noopener">CC BY 4.0</a>,
            &copy; Stichting PauseAI (kvk 92951031). That licence is why this
            site exists in the shape it does — we did not have to ask anyone,
            and neither do you.
        </p>

        @if (Content.AdaptedPages.Count > 0)
        {
            <p>
                @Content.AdaptedPages.Count
                @(Content.AdaptedPages.Count == 1 ? "page" : "pages")
                on this site are adapted from PauseAI. Each has been condensed
                and rewritten for a Philadelphia audience, so the wording is
                ours and any errors in it are ours too:
            </p>

            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th scope="col">Our page</th>
                        <th scope="col">Adapted from</th>
                        <th scope="col">Licence</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    @* Loop variable is not called "page": Razor parses
                       "@page.Foo" as the @page directive (RZ2005). *@
                    @foreach (var entry in Content.AdaptedPages)
                    {
                        <tr>
                            <td><a href="@("/" + entry.Slug)">@entry.Title</a></td>
                            <td><a href="@entry.Source!.ToString()" rel="noopener">@entry.Source!.AbsolutePath.Trim('/')</a></td>
                            <td>CC BY 4.0</td>
                        </tr>
                    }
                </tbody>
            </table>
        }
        else
        {
            <p>No page on this site is currently adapted from PauseAI.</p>
        }

        <h2>Other credits</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>
                Survey and polling figures are compiled by PauseAI at
                <a href="https://pauseai.info/polls-and-surveys" target="_blank" rel="noopener">polls-and-surveys</a>.
            </li>
            <li>
                Quotations are drawn from PauseAI's sourced collection at
                <a href="https://pauseai.info/quotes" target="_blank" rel="noopener">quotes</a>,
                checked against the originals.
            </li>
            <li>
                Typeface: <a href="https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Archivo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Archivo</a>,
                under the SIL Open Font License.
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Corrections</h2>
        <p>
            If a claim here is unsourced, misattributed or wrong, that is a bug.
            Email <a href="mailto:support@phillypause.org?subject=Correction">support@phillypause.org</a> or
            open an issue on
            <a href="https://github.com/PhillyPause/Platform/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>,
            and we will source it, correct it, or remove it.
        </p>
    </article>
</div>
